<title>JAPAN: Yagi Antenna - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yagi Antenna - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.14		vs	    8.75</p>
<p> Operating	  329    million    vs	  244    million</p>
<p> Current	    293    million    vs	  208    million</p>
<p> Net		  158    million    vs	  115    million</p>
<p> EPS		   11.02 yen	  vs	    8.19 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yagi Antenna Co Ltd is a developer-maker of Yagi TV antennas.</p>
